{
  "name": "instagram-poster",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-readme",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 640,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## instagram-poster\nWebhook-triggered, per-platform posting workflow. Credentials come from the request payload only \u2014 never stored in n8n (see websitePlan.md \u00a75).\n\n**After importing:** activate the workflow, copy the Webhook node's *Production URL* (or use the Test URL while the editor is open in listen mode), then:\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/instagram-poster \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\n    \"post_id\": \"pst_test001\",\n    \"user_id\": \"usr_test\",\n    \"platform\": \"instagram\",\n    \"content\": \"Test caption #smposting\",\n    \"media_type\": \"IMAGE\",\n    \"media_urls\": [\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-XXXX\"],\n    \"token\": {\n      \"ig_business_id\": \"YOUR_IG_BUSINESS_ID\",\n      \"access_token\": \"YOUR_LONG_LIVED_TOKEN\",\n      \"graph_host\": \"https://graph.facebook.com\"\n    },\n    \"callback_url\": \"https://webhook.site/your-id\"\n  }'\n```\n\n`media_type` accepts `IMAGE | CAROUSEL | REELS | STORIES`. For `CAROUSEL`, `media_urls` should have 2+ entries. `callback_url` is optional \u2014 defaults to the backend's future `/api/webhooks/n8n-callback` route; point it at webhook.site while there's no backend yet to see the result payload.\n\n`token.graph_host` selects which Graph API host the access token is valid against: `https://graph.facebook.com` for Instagram accounts linked via a Facebook Page, `https://graph.instagram.com` for accounts connected via standalone Instagram Login. Defaults to `https://graph.facebook.com` if omitted."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -260,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "instagram-poster",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "instagram-poster",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "parse-request",
      "name": "Parse Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -40,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    post_id: body.post_id,\n    user_id: body.user_id,\n    platform: body.platform || 'instagram',\n    content: body.content || '',\n    media_type: String(body.media_type || '').toUpperCase(),\n    media_urls: body.media_urls || [],\n    ig_user_id: body.token && body.token.ig_business_id,\n    access_token: body.token && body.token.access_token,\n    graph_host: (body.token && body.token.graph_host) || 'https://graph.facebook.com',\n    callback_url: body.callback_url || 'http://localhost:5000/api/webhooks/n8n-callback'\n  }\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
